---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Soccer100 vs FootyBite: Best Free Soccer Streams";
const description = "Compare Soccer100 and FootyBite for live football. Find out which site offers better soccer streams and totalsportek style links for free HD matches.";
const keywords = "soccer100, soccer streams, totalsportek, soccer100 vs footybite, best streaming site";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} keywords={keywords}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none theme-text-primary">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-[#f3a833] mb-8">{title}</h1>
      
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        In the world of free football, two sites are very popular: <strong>Soccer100</strong> and FootyBite. Both give fans access to <strong>soccer streams</strong>. However, <strong>Soccer100</strong> uses the best parts of <strong>totalsportek</strong> to give fans a better experience.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">Design and Use</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        <strong>Soccer100</strong> is known for being clean and easy to use. It is simple to find <strong>soccer streams</strong> on our site. Unlike FootyBite or old <strong>totalsportek</strong> mirrors, we focus on making things easy so you can find your match fast.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">Streaming Quality</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        Both sites are good for <strong>soccer streams</strong>. <strong>Soccer100</strong> is great because it has many backup links, just like <strong>totalsportek</strong> used to have.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">Stability and HD Video</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        Both <strong>Soccer100</strong> and FootyBite get <strong>soccer streams</strong> from different places.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-4 mb-8">
        <li><strong>Soccer100:</strong> We have many links for every match. This means fans can always find a connection, even when many people are watching.</li>
        <li><strong>FootyBite:</strong> Often focuses on very clear HD links. They may have fewer links, but the ones they have are usually very good quality.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">Leagues Covered</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        Both sites cover the big European leagues and the Champions League. But <strong>Soccer100</strong> often has more international games and smaller leagues from around the world, making it a better choice for all fans.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">Watching on Mobile</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        For watching on your phone, <strong>Soccer100</strong> is the winner. It is very fast and works great on mobile browsers. FootyBite also works on phones, but it can be a bit harder to use on small screens.
      </p>

      <div class="theme-card p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/10 my-10 bg-white/5 shadow-inner text-center">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mb-3">The Verdict:</h3>
        <p class="text-lg">If you want <strong>simplicity and reliability</strong>, <strong>Soccer100</strong> is the best choice. If you want <strong>HD focus</strong> and sports news, <strong>FootyBite</strong> is also good. Many fans use both to make sure they never miss a match.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">Conclusion</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        Whether you use <strong>Soccer100</strong> or FootyBite, you are getting good <strong>soccer streams</strong> for free. Both sites are trusted by football fans. We recommend using both so you are always ready for the game.
      </p>
    </article>
    
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
      <a href="/blog/" class="text-[#f3a833] font-bold hover:underline">← Back to Blog</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
